### 404 → #not-found
GET {{host}}/nada
  
### 405 → link de tools.ietf.org
POST {{host}}/weatherforecast

### 401 sin token → #unauthorized
GET {{host}}/weatherforecast

### 200 con token
GET {{host}}/weatherforecast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 200 con token
GET {{host}}/weatherforecast
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenTenantUser}}

